:name: HartLab PolarFire playground
:description: Bare-metal PolarFire with Icicle LED overlay and multi-hart GDB stub

# Paths are relative to the repo root (the fidelity runner and docs set cwd there).
# `$ROOT/foo` does not expand under Renode 1.16 `@$ROOT/...`.
$bin?=@examples/rust/blinky/target/riscv64gc-unknown-none-elf/release/blinky

using sysbus
mach create "icicle"

machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/polarfire/playground.repl
include @platforms/polarfire/playground.py

# e51 is rv64imac; U54s are rv64gc. Renode 1.16 will not default to one stub.
# "all" matches SoftConsole: five threads in one GDB. xPack RISC-V GDB handles both.
machine StartGdbServer 3333 false cpuCluster="all"

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    # SoftConsole/GDB load only programs e51; copy PC onto the app hart.
    u54_1 PC `e51 PC`
    u54_2 IsHalted true
    u54_3 IsHalted true
    u54_4 IsHalted true
"""
runMacro $reset

echo "HartLab PolarFire ready. GDB: target remote :3333"
echo "Select U54_1 (usually GDB thread 2), then continue."
